WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Which function has slope 2x?

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.390
x² does.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:11.760
But so does x² + 5, and x² − 7.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.790
Adding a number moves the graph up, not its slope.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:21.013
Going backwards from a slope is called integrating.
